      "content_md": "If one had a narrowband filter for the viewer presumably it would be possible to make a white light viewable transmission hologram. Hence would it be possible to make a white light viewable hologram on embossed foil, with full parallax, if one could find a narrowband filter to laminate on top? Are there any filter materials that would do and be cheap?\n\nSimon",
